    "related_variants": [],
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "The recipe needs about ten ingredients. The two that matter most are man and beast. The human must be a virgin girl with Gu Master aptitude at least C grade; A or B grade raises the chance of success. The beast side is an Enslavement Gu such as Bear Enslavement Gu, Wolf Enslavement Gu, Tiger Enslavement Gu, Deer Enslavement Gu, or Bull Enslavement Gu. Carnivores eat the body more easily, while herbivores need the Enslavement Gu to force the meal. After the beast eats her whole, down to the tiniest scrap for the greatest effect, refinement must start before digestion finishes. Fang Yuan forces a black bear through Single Aperture Charcoal Gu, Kerosene Gu, other merit-bought Gu, a rank two poison Gu, and about a thousand primeval stones until Man-beast Life Burial Gu forms.",
        "chapters": [
          152
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "recipe-and-breakthrough",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_master",
          "sys_enslavement_gu",
          "gu_bear_enslavement_gu",
          "gu_wolf_enslavement_gu",
          "gu_tiger_enslavement_gu",
          "gu_deer_enslavement_gu",
          "gu_bull_enslavement_gu",
          "sys_poison_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The finished Gu is rank three and expenditure-type. It looks like a black spider with furry long legs and a bear’s head, and on its back a blood-coloured tattoo outlines Gu Yue Yao Le’s face. Fang Yuan swallows it; black-red water pours into his aperture, and when enough of that essence hits the white crystal walls he advances to rank three with a light-membrane wall. Leftover black-red essence kills Gu if injected, and if left in the aperture it pollutes the walls and cuts aptitude. After repeated purges a trace remains, an unavoidable cost of the Gu. Cleansing Water Gu is the common way to wash that impurity away.",
        "chapters": [
          152
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "recipe-and-breakthrough",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_gu_yue_yao_le",
          "gu_cleansing_water_gu"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
