  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "During the wolf tide on Qing Mao Mountain, Fang Yuan turns from the ordinary rank two to rank three route and settles on refining Man-beast Life Burial Gu, recalling an ancient devil path sect leader who invented the recipe to strengthen subordinates. In his previous life he found that recipe while exploring unknown places and kept it firmly in mind. He treats the wolf tide as a gathering window because the fusion materials are not rare, though they would take years in peacetime.",
        "chapters": [
          148
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_qing_mao_mountain",
          "char_fang_yuan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan had nearly spent his savings refining Man-beast Life Burial Gu before Chi faction money arrived.",
        "chapters": [
          155
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "aptitude-loss",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "fac_chi_family"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "After he uses Cleansing Water Gu, the side effect is gone, and his aptitude has fallen from 44% C grade by 2%, to 42%.",
        "chapters": [
          159
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "aptitude-loss",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Under Blood Skull Gu use he recalls that after Man-beast Life Burial Gu his aptitude had dropped from 44% C grade to 43%, then the blood stream raises aptitude by 10% to 53%.",
        "chapters": [
          198
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "blood-skull-recall",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_demonic_blood_skull_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
